# VoltTrail — Cloudflare Pages redirects
# Real per-route static files are served directly. Unmatched paths fall through to 404.html.
# Canonicalisation: force apex host (www -> non-www). Cloudflare auto-upgrades http -> https.
https://www.volttrail.org/*  https://volttrail.org/:splat  301!

# Agent-ready files: the .well-known dotfolder cannot be uploaded via the CF dashboard
# (Cloudflare ignores dot-prefixed folders AND rejects extensionless files on Direct Upload).
# Files live in /well-known/ with .json extensions and are proxied (200 rewrite) to their
# canonical /.well-known/ URLs (extensionless where the spec requires it) so agents/scanners
# find them at the spec-required paths.
/.well-known/api-catalog                /well-known/api-catalog.json                200
/.well-known/agent-skills/index.json    /well-known/agent-skills/index.json         200
/.well-known/mcp/server-card.json       /well-known/mcp/server-card.json            200
/.well-known/oauth-protected-resource   /well-known/oauth-protected-resource.json   200
/.well-known/oauth-authorization-server /well-known/oauth-authorization-server.json 200
/.well-known/openid-configuration       /well-known/openid-configuration.json       200
/.well-known/acp.json                   /well-known/acp.json                        200
/.well-known/ucp                        /well-known/ucp.json                        200
/auth.md                                /auth.txt                                   200

# The /product/ directory has no index page — send it to the dirt bike shop.
/product                                        /electric-dirt-bikes/      301
/product/                                       /electric-dirt-bikes/      301

